{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_44_1283355870#1_2708552300","relevance":3,"reason":"The NASA Mars 2020 Perseverance press kit segment is dedicated to the rover power system and directly explains that the MMRTG works like a nuclear battery, converting heat from plutonium-238 decay into steady electricity, charging batteries, powering the rover, and providing excess heat for tools and systems.","learned":"Plutonium-238 improves Mars rover technology by enabling reliable nuclear-battery power and thermal control through MMRTGs."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q984","reason":"The focused MMRTG rover query is returning highly relevant direct evidence from authoritative and mission-specific sources; continue for another likely grade-3 result within the remaining budget."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q984"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_944649975#4_2118918933","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q984","rank":6,"snippet":"of RTGs What’s next? What is Plutonium-238? What is Pu-238 used for? Why does NASA need more Pu-238? How is Pu-238 made? What is INL’s role? Who is funding the production of Pu-238? What happens if a rocket carrying Pu-238 has a problem on takeoff? What is a Radioisotope Power System? How does an RTG work? Developing RTGs History of RTGs What’s next? What is <cover>Plutonium-238? What is Pu-238 used for? Why does NASA need more Pu-238? How is Pu-238 made? What is INL’s role? Who is funding the production of Pu-238? Multimedia Gallery MARS 2020 ROVER by Marco_Romero \" , \"segment\": \"The next MMRTG </cover>will power the Dragonfly rotorcraft lander mission to explore Saturn’s largest moon, Titan. Dragonfly is scheduled to launch in 2026. INL would fuel and test that power source. And there’s more ahead for INL’s Space Nuclear Power and Isotope Technologies Division (SNPIT), which is getting more involved in space reactors for both nuclear thermal propulsion and fission surface power applications. NATIONAL LABS FUEL SPACE EXPLORATION Perseverance will be the first rover to ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_22_944649975#8_2118930959","rank":5,"relevance":3}]}}
